      "options": {
        "content": "### Approved-response catalog and template-gap queue\nJason must prefer an AOT-approved communication template before drafting client-facing wording. If no approved template fits, Jason creates a reusable proposed template request using the deterministic AOT HTML shell. Proposed templates are **not approved and cannot be treated as send authority** until reviewed/published. Autotask's documented API does not expose Notification Template definitions, so the Jason catalog is the authoritative governed content source until a supported provider read surface exists.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
